FR:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bah alors ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Fallait surtout pas vous
presser, hein...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Encore un peu, et je venais vous
chercher en personne,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ihr seid spät dran, ihr zwei!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich wollt schon die Laufschuhe
schnüren und nach euch sehen,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}El otro día cuando me entrenaba
para hacer salto de altura encontré
esto en el suelo. {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Es tuyo, ¿no?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Vorrei che mi prestassi il libro
più pesante che hai.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}I miei muscoli amano la cultura!
Ogni volta che faccio le flessioni,
mi metto dei libri sulla schiena!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}So che tu ne hai uno bello pesante!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sarebbe perfetto per me,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Koleksiyonundaki en kalın kitabı
ödünç almak istiyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Şınav çekerken
sırtıma kalın kitaplar
diziyorum da!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Aynen!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sende o bayağı ağır olan var!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tam ağırlık olur, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Aslında, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}kas işini çözdüm sayılır.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Şimdi biraz da beyin kaslarımı
çalıştırmak istiyorum!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bana iyi bir kitap
önerebilir misin?
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}
